            "summary": "Speaking on behalf of current and prospective Orion co-op families, she urged the district to add a third TK co-op class to accommodate the large waitlist and to prioritize bolstering lower-grade enrollment at Orion to maintain healthy upper-grade class sizes."
          },
          {
