            "startSeconds": 814,
            "endSeconds": 944,
            "summary": "As a labor association representative, she urged the board and district to prioritize in-person meetings over virtual ones for difficult issues such as legal matters, citing the importance of face-to-face communication for building bonds and effective resolution."
